    "scr_dup": "001",
    "tpa_score_new": "<div>Attendance and participation: 20%, individual</div>\n\n<div>In-class exams (#1, #2, and #3 each worth 15%): 45%, individual</div>\n\n<div>Assignment 1 (Midterm): an analysis of business model: 15%, group</div>\n\n<div>Assignment 2 (Final term): a comparative analysis of business models and an identification of market opportunity: 20%, group</div>\n\n<div>Certification examinations and/or business competitions (each effort worth 5%): extra 10%, individual</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>The maximum of semester grades: 92</div>\n",
    "tpa_score_new_en": " ",
    "course_pol": "1. 同學上課時應依老師引導、根據課程需要使用手機，禁止玩遊戲等非課程相關的使用行為。\n2. 同學上課時須遵守課堂秩序，尊重他人上課權益。\n3. 未能到課者請依規定完成請假，缺曠課過多將影響學期成績。\n4. 以上規則適用實體及線上授課。",
    "course_pol_en": null,
    "course_rem": " ",
    "course_rem_en": null,
    "ais_meno": "<div>1. 同學應盡力參與完成團體報告，避免搭便車、抄襲等情形。<br />\n2. 考試時遵守考試規則。<br />\n3. 違反以上學術行為，學期成績將不及格。情節嚴重者，依「逢甲大學學生獎懲辦法」辦理。</div>\n",
    "ais_meno_en": null,
